[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11700.309, "timestamp": "03:15:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11703.19, "timestamp": "03:15:03", "text": "你知道吗，我在艺术大学工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11705.51, "timestamp": "03:15:05", "text": "让我问问这位艺术家吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11709.269, "timestamp": "03:15:09", "text": "他们可能会在那里证明价格的合理性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11711.65, "timestamp": "03:15:11", "text": "能够更好地解释清楚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11714.389, "timestamp": "03:15:14", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11717.91, "timestamp": "03:15:17", "text": "是的。但是，嗯，就像……那里有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11721.99, "timestamp": "03:15:21", "text": "如果我是的话，未来也会有类似的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11724.79, "timestamp": "03:15:24", "text": "用这幅画来首次亮相……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11727.59, "timestamp": "03:15:27", "text": "现在就做这个模型。就像我正在设置一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11729.51, "timestamp": "03:15:29", "text": "质量标准之类的东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11732.15, "timestamp": "03:15:32", "text": "然后是所有未来的资产或其他什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11735.429, "timestamp": "03:15:35", "text": "必须达到那种质量水平，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11737.429, "timestamp": "03:15:37", "text": "某物。就是这样，就是这样，就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11740.309, "timestamp": "03:15:40", "text": "我最讨厌的就是这一点。我打算多花钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11742.79, "timestamp": "03:15:42", "text": "归根结底还是钱的问题。什么？什么？什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11744.63, "timestamp": "03:15:44", "text": "这？我不想在这个时候做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11751.59, "timestamp": "03:15:51", "text": "方案。你获得的资产，你拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11758.309, "timestamp": "03:15:58", "text": "不，不，不，不，不。我觉得乔，我觉得"}]